      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly state the canonical definition of mean square error as “squaring the differences between signals and their approximations and then averaging them.”",
        "The packet describes that the method is “stepwise optimal” by minimizing “the mean square error norm” at each iteration and that it “minimize[s] the mean value of the error norm squared,” but it does not supply the specific squaring-and-averaging formulation used in the first sentence of the definition.",
        "The claim that it is used “to choose a representation that best fits a set of signals overall” is only partially supported (it is used to select/optimize a subspace in the pursuit algorithm), but the packet does not clearly support the broader “best fits overall” wording as stated."
